OL,3,AVeteran BBC Africa correspondent Mark
OL,4,ADoyle dies aged 67
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing Doyle's death, BBC foreign
OL,7,Feditor Paul Danahar said he was a
OL,8,F"legendary figure", as well as a"
OL,9,Fbrilliant, brave, empathetic reporter".
